<title>FRANCE: EU sets 32.50 Ecu export refund on unroasted malt.</title>
<headline>EU sets 32.50 Ecu export refund on unroasted malt.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday set a daily refund of 32.50 Ecus per tonne for the export of unroasted malt in the new 1996/97 season, grain traders said.</p>
<p>The refund is valid for 11 months, September included, they said. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
